.TH OMZTTY 1 "2026-11" "oh-my-ztty" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
omztty \- a lean Project Z terminal workspace
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omztty
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches a preset zsh environment in the current terminal or bundled ztty.
The suite includes zshard, zdot and ssmcp. No service is started implicitly.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B shell
Run zsh with the suite configuration. Additional arguments are passed to zsh.
.TP
.B terminal
Open ztty running the suite shell. Additional arguments are ztty options.
.TP
.B ai
Connect the current directory using bundled ssmcp.
.TP
.B dot
Run bundled zdot.
.TP
.B zshard
Manage shell plugins.
.TP
.B doctor
Check system and bundled components without connecting to a remote service.
.TP
.B update
Install the latest published release, verifying its checksum.
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove suite-owned runtime files and links. Preserve user configuration and history.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/oh-my-ztty/local.zsh
Optional user customization. XDG_CONFIG_HOME is respected.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/oh-my-ztty
Versioned runtime. XDG_DATA_HOME is respected.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/oh-my-ztty/history
Shell history. XDG_STATE_HOME is respected.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zsh (1),
.BR git (1),
.BR zdot (1),
.BR ssmcp (1)
